  "content_html": "<p class=\"mobile-date-eyebrow\">12th September 2026</p>\n<div class=\"beat beat-sighting\">\n\n\n<div class=\"beat-content\">\n  <div class=\"beat-row1\">\n    <a class=\"beat-label sighting\" href=\"/elsewhere/sighting/\">Sighting</a>\n    <span class=\"beat-title\">2:16 PM</span>\n    <span class=\"beat-commit\">&mdash; California Brown Pelican, in San Mateo County, CA, US</span>\n  </div>\n  <captioned-image-gallery class=\"sighting-detail-gallery\" max-row-items=\"2\">\n    <figure><a href=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/733368932/large.jpg\"><img src=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/733368932/large.jpg\" alt=\"California Brown Pelican\" loading=\"lazy\" data-width=\"2048\" data-height=\"1365\"></a><figcaption><a href=\"https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/399708714\" title=\"View observation on iNaturalist\">California Brown Pelican</a></figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/733368989/large.jpg\"><img src=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/733368989/large.jpg\" alt=\"California Brown Pelican\" loading=\"lazy\" data-width=\"2048\" data-height=\"1365\"></a><figcaption><a href=\"https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/399708714\" title=\"View observation on iNaturalist\">California Brown Pelican</a></figcaption></figure>\n  </captioned-image-gallery>\n<div class=\"beat-note blogmark-body\"><p>The <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacifica_Pier\">Pacifica Pier</a> shut down at the start of June after a crack in the concrete walkway made access to the pier unsafe.</p>\n<p>It has since been entirely taken over by pelicans!</p></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"entryFooter\">Posted <a href=\"/2026/Sep/12/\">12th September 2026</a> at 9:16 pm</div>\n<p class=\"edit-page-link\" data-admin-url=\"/admin/blog/beat/4928/\"></p>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n</div> <!-- #primary -->\n\n<div id=\"secondary\">\n\n\n\n</div> <!-- #secondary -->\n</div> <!-- #wrapper -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div i